    "n-confirm": {
      "fill": "green",
      "text": "New in M2, approved by the owner on 2026-11-17 (task T-207, decision D-036). Customers can log in before confirming, but cannot make a voice or video until they do. Confirmation links work once and expire after 24 hours. Desktop only (D-033).",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 4560,
      "y": 7000
    },
    "t-payment": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "text": "Buying credits (M4)",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 8100,
      "maxW": 3000,
      "w": 240
    },
    "n-payment": {
      "fill": "green",
      "text": "M4, approved by the owner on 2026-11-17 and updated by the owner's change requests: customers buy 1,000 to 10,000 credits (D-059), quick picks 1,000 / 2,500 / 5,000 / 10,000, and pay a 2% payment fee on top (D-060). This board shows the endings after Razorpay closes, including \"Back to your video\" (D-061). Credits are added only when our server confirms the payment. Desktop only (D-033).",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 8400
    },
    "t-m5create": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "text": "M5: create flow additions",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 9500,
      "maxW": 9560,
      "w": 240
    },
    "n-m5create": {
      "fill": "green",
      "text": "Approved by the owner on 2026-11-17. Consent (wording approved, Q-11) comes before the voice is made (D-045). A saved voice from a video that did not finish can start a new video with no voice charge; its script and language are locked (D-043, D-050). Banners that could not be added: full price, told plainly (Q-17). Create 1, 2 and 3 were updated to match.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 9120,
      "y": 9800
    },
    "t-m5fail": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "text": "M5: failures and limits",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 11300,
      "maxW": 3480,
      "w": 240
    },
    "n-m5fail": {
      "fill": "green",
      "text": "Approved by the owner on 2026-11-17. Every failure says what happened, what was charged and what to do next. Voice failed or unknown: 10 credits returned. Voice too long, or the video failed: the 10 voice credits stay and the voice is saved for a new video. Video failed: the held credits return. Unknown video outcome: charged, flagged, checked within 2 working days and refunded if no video was made (D-051; support address still to be set). The 50-videos-a-day limit applies in development and testing only (D-046).",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 11600
    },
    "t-m5lib": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "text": "M5: library",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 13100,
      "maxW": 5000,
      "w": 240
    },
    "n-m5lib": {
      "fill": "green",
      "text": "Approved by the owner on 2026-11-17. Video detail, delete-script confirmation and empty states for a new customer. The video detail page shows what the video cost from the server: voice 10 credits plus video 240 credits in the example.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 4560,
      "y": 13400
    },
    "n-banners": {
      "fill": "green",
      "text": "Owner change request, 2026-11-17 (D-058): banners are off by default. The customer switches on \"Add banners\" to see the start and end lists. Without banners the progress has no \"Adding your banners\" step (see the M5 progress board).",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 9640,
      "y": 10860
    },
    "n-topup": {
      "fill": "green",
      "text": "Owner change request, 2026-11-17 (D-061), approved by the owner 2026-11-17: when the voice is ready but credits are short, \"Add credits\" opens Buy credits at 1,000; after paying, \"Back to your video\" returns here with Approve enabled.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 12760,
      "y": 8400
    }
